Cindrix Pocket (field tools are built from Cindrix Scan, same licenses)

Heading font: TeX Gyre Heros Condensed Bold, copyright GUST e-foundry, used under the
GUST Font License. See licenses/GUST-FONT-LICENSE.txt.

Barcode decoding: ZXing ("Zebra Crossing"), Apache License 2.0.
Other libraries: AndroidX, Jetpack Compose and CameraX, Apache License 2.0.

Pocket logo: the CindrixOps logo, from Cindrix Ops.
GPS: the phone's own location service (android.location.LocationManager). No Google Play services, no network.

Map page (Maps screen): MapLibre GL JS and Protomaps basemaps, both BSD 3-Clause, bundled into the app by the build
(mapweb/). Their licence texts are inside the app (assets/map/LICENSES.txt). Map drawing, coordinates and shape code
is copied from the Cindrix map viewer (Stormchyld2/Cindrix-map-viewer). Map data in a .cmap file keeps its own credits
(OpenStreetMap contributors; USGS The National Map) and the map page shows them.
